# L6 Skia host spike (browser/l6-skia; browser.md §2 Skia pin): committed =
# fetch script + pinned revision + checksums + WebKit recipe files + build &
# smoke sources; the 80 MB archive (googlesource container sha is NOT
# reproducible), the extracted upstream tree and the host build tree are
# rebuilt by fetch.sh / build.sh.
third_party/skia-588b550/skia-*.tar.gz
third_party/skia-588b550/src/
third_party/skia-588b550/build-host/
third_party/skia-588b550/.fetched-ok

# L6 ICU host-first vendoring (browser/l6-icu; browser.md §2 ICU pin): the
# committed set = fetch.sh + digest records (.sha256/.md5/SHASUM512.txt) +
# README + build-host.sh + build-host-trimmed.sh + data-filter-en.json +
# smoke/; the 27 MB sources tarball, the 20 MB data-sources zip, the
# extracted upstream tree and the host build tree are rebuilt by fetch.sh /
# the build scripts.
third_party/icu-78.3/icu4c-78.3-sources.tgz
third_party/icu-78.3/icu4c-78.3-data.zip
third_party/icu-78.3/src/
third_party/icu-78.3/build-host/

